second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Who is the artist of \\\"The Coast Is Clear\\\"?\", \"slot_hint\": \"artist\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 212, \"text\": \"The Coast Is Clear (In-Flight Safety album) The Coast Is Clear is the debut album by Canadian indie rock band In-Flight Safety, released on January 24, 2006 on Dead Daisy Records and distributed by Outside Music.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d00\", \"start\": 213, \"end\": 363, \"text\": \"The album was recognized by the music industry, with the group winning three awards at the 2006 Nova Scotia Music Awards, including Album of the Year.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d00\", \"start\": 364, \"end\": 466, \"text\": \"In 2007, they won three East Coast Music Awards, including Group Recording of the Year for this album.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d00\", \"start\": 467, \"end\": 564, \"text\": \"The music video for \\\"Coast Is Clear\\\" was nominated for Video of the Year at the 2007 Juno Awards.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d00\", \"start\": 565, \"end\": 569, \"text\": \"Lead\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 135, \"text\": \"The Coast Is Clear (Tracy Lawrence album) The Coast Is Clear is the fifth studio album released by country music artist Tracy Lawrence.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d01\", \"start\": 136, \"end\": 292, \"text\": \"It produced five singles: \\\"How a Cowgirl Says Goodbye\\\", \\\"Better Man, Better Off\\\", \\\"The Coast Is Clear\\\", \\\"One Step Ahead of the Storm\\\" and \\\"While You Sleep\\\".\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d01\", \"start\": 293, \"end\": 466, \"text\": \"Though the first two singles charted at #2 and #4 on the country chart, respectively, the title track was the first single of Lawrence's career to fall short of the Top Ten.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d01\", \"start\": 467, \"end\": 562, \"text\": \"\\\"While You Sleep\\\" missed the Top 40 entirely, and \\\"One Step Ahead of the Storm\\\" failed to chart\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 7, \"text\": \"UTC ) .\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d02\", \"start\": 8, \"end\": 118, \"text\": \"Text is available under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 License ; additional terms may apply .\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d02\", \"start\": 119, \"end\": 190, \"text\": \"By using this site , you agree to the Terms of Use and Privacy Policy .\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d02\", \"start\": 191, \"end\": 262, \"text\": \"Wikipedia® is a registered trademark of the Wikimedia Foundation , Inc.\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d02\", \"start\": 263, \"end\": 292, \"text\": \", a non-profit organization .\"}, \"D3S6\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d02\", \"start\": 293, \"end\": 477, \"text\": \"Privacy policy About Wikipedia Disclaimers Contact Wikipedia Code of Conduct Developers Statistics Cookie statement Mobile view Search Search The Coast Is Clear Add languages Add topic\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0109-54db66cc8ec1:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 622